cases.prompt:
Use $principle-build-the-lever to migrate these local JSON job definitions from timeout_ms to timeout_seconds. Create the files from the raw contents below in your permitted output directory, make the migration, and leave a reviewer enough evidence to rerun it. Preserve every unrelated field. Values must preserve duration exactly. No commits are requested.
alpha.json: {"job":"alpha","timeout_ms":1500,"retry":2}
beta.json: {"job":"beta","timeout_ms":2000,"retry":0}
gamma.json: {"job":"gamma","timeout_seconds":3,"retry":1}
The project has no existing migration tool. Only these three files are in scope.
